              <characteristics>
                <characteristic name="Text" typeId="63ac-8f60-d28a-2232">Skirmishers have improvised weapon, javelins and buckler. Skirmishers. Feigned Flight. Every third unit of skirmishers may exchange javelin for sling (free) or bow (+1) point per model. This unit cannot be larger than the smallest javelin armed skirmisher unit in the army.</characteristic>
