            <profile id="ded0-3f64-a04a-1e5a" name="Equipment and options (as printed in WAB2 army list)" publicationId="fcb9-17be-94c2-bcfc" hidden="false" typeId="b19e-ee0c-17d1-6e33" typeName="Equipment and Notes">
              <characteristics>
                <characteristic name="Text" typeId="63ac-8f60-d28a-2232">The mahout is unarmed; the two crew have hand weapon and javelins. A third crewman may be added (+9). They may exchange javelins for composite bow (+1 each). The elephant may be fitted with a howdah (+6) and shields may be attached to the outside (+1 per crewman). The howdah provides a 5+ save increased to 4+ by adding shields. Allies/ Mercenaries If the army includes Imitation Legionaries, then it may select one unit of Spanish Heavy Cavalry from the Spanish list, paid for from the cavalry point allowance but this unit must be joined by the General.</characteristic>
              </characteristics>
            </profile>
          </profiles>
          <infoLinks>
            <infoLink id="9dc9-7f6c-c233-2bca" name="Hand Weapon" hidden="false" targetId="a423-b782-e1ce-43e2" type="profile"/>
